        "original_id": "eb209f4b-6257-5725-ad57-0428ea986269",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eddie Leonski, Edward Joseph Leonski, Mary Charleston\n- Products: Death of a Soldier, Prisoner, The Last Outlaw\n- Places: Melbourne, Australia\n- Topics: serial killing, film and television roles\n\nFacts:\n- Edward Joseph Leonski was born on December 12, 1917.\n- Eddie Leonski was an American soldier and serial killer who strangled three women in Melbourne, Australia.\n- Edward Joseph Leonski died on November 9, 1942.\n- Death of a Soldier is a 1986 Australian film based on the life of American serial killer Eddie Leonski.\n- In the 1970s and early 1980s, Mary Charleston guest starred in several television films and series.\n- Mary Charleston is best remembered for playing Linda Goldman in the cult soap opera Prisoner.\n- Mary Charleston appeared in the 1980 television miniseries The Last Outlaw.\n- Mary Charleston appeared in the 1986 war film Death of a Soldier.",
